config OPLUS_TRIKEY_MAIN
	tristate "OnePlus tri-state alert slider"
	depends on GPIOLIB && OF && EXTCON
	help
	  Driver for the OnePlus three-position alert slider found on
	  OnePlus 7 Pro, 8 Pro, 9 Pro, 10 Pro, 11, and variants.

	  Uses two GPIO inputs from hall-effect position sensors to detect
	  ring / vibrate / silent slider positions, reported via extcon.

	  To compile as a module, choose M here.
